@server = http://localhost:8080

### Get steps taken
GET {{server}}/api/v1/steps

### Start over
POST {{server}}/api/v1/steps
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "type": "init",
    "reasoning": "Start over"
  }
]

### Redo all steps (may time out, but should finish)
POST {{server}}/api/v1/steps/redo

